/*——有bug的话，调💽的数值，💿是次选调动可顺便一起调了，✒️是可以自己改自定义文案。
建议使用美化区推荐的扩展插件或酒馆工具区的主题美化css实时编码搜关键词改动。

例子：上下 top：0px，正数数字-下移，负数数字-上移。

代码成分很杂，是属于拼拼乐，除去一半自己肘的代码以外，其他代码有参考借用类名和使用了拼好码and一些小伙伴的代码。

不要二传商用，就算有人偷偷上闲鱼卖了其实我也知道，贩子是打不完的。
by：阿遥/Lyo——*/



/*字体*/
@import url("https://fontsapi.zeoseven.com/310/main/result.css");

body {
    font-family: "NanoFullSong";
    font-weight: normal;
}

/*顶栏*/
#top-bar {
    position: fixed;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 35;
    background: none;
    border: 0;
    box-shadow: none;
    overflow: visible;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    left: 0;
    right: auto;
}

#top-bar::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0px;
    left: 0;
    right: auto;
    bottom: auto;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXjDyqN.png');
    transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg) !important;
    background-size: auto;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: left top;
    border: 0px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);
    border-radius: 0px;
    z-index: 9;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 9999px) {
    #top-bar {
        width: 100vw;
        height: auto;
        overflow: visible !important;
    }

    #top-bar::before {
        min-width: 100%;
        min-height: 100px;
        background-size: contain;
        background-position: center top;
    }
}


/*顶栏小装饰*/
#top-bar::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -60px; 
    left: 90%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 40px; /* 装饰宽度 */
    height: 40px; /* 装饰高度 */
    background-image: url(''); 
    background-size: contain;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    background-position: center;
    z-index: 10000;
    pointer-events: none;
}


/*图标*/
#top-settings-holder .drawer-icon::before {
    content: '' !important;
    visibility: hidden; 
}

#top-settings-holder .drawer {
    flex: 1; 
}

/* 顶栏图标代码 */
#top-settings-holder .drawer-icon {
    display: block; 
    margin: 0 auto;
    background-size: contain;
    background-position: center;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
    transition: all 0.3s ease-in-out;
    width: 24px; /* 图标宽度 */
    height: 24px; /* 图标高度 */
    opacity: 0 !important;
}

#top-settings-holder:hover .drawer-icon,#table_drawer_icon::before {
    opacity: 0.25 !important;
}

.drawer-icon.fa-fw:hover {
    transform: scale(1.2); 
    opacity: 1 !important; 
}


/* AI响应配置 */
.drawer-icon.fa-sliders {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

/* API连接 */
.drawer-icon.fa-plug {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

/* AI回复格式化 */
.drawer-icon.fa-font {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

/* 世界书信息 */
.drawer-icon.fa-book-atlas {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

/* 美化主题设置 */
#user-settings-button .drawer-icon {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

/* 背景图 */
#backgrounds-drawer-toggle .drawer-icon,
#logo_block .drawer-icon {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

 /* 扩展 */
.drawer-icon.fa-cubes {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png');
}

/* 记忆表格 */
.drawer-icon.fa-bars-progress,#table_drawer_icon::before,.drawer-icon.fa-regular.fa-clock.fa-fw {
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png') !important; 
}

/* 用户角色管理 */
.drawer-icon.fa-face-smile {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}

/* 角色卡 */
.drawer-icon.fa-address-card {
   background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXwWspf.png'); 
}


/* 隐藏滚动条 */
::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
}



/* 1.中间气泡层 */
.mes {
  position: relative;
  z-index: -2;

  max-width: 390px;/*💽气泡层大小，也就是适配手机的尺寸大小，自己尝试适配多少px*/

  margin: 160px auto 80px !important; /*💽历史和最新消息的间缝大小*/
  background-size: 100% auto; 

  background-image: url('https://iili.io/Bu2XKSs.jpg'); 
  background-repeat: repeat-y;

  overflow: visible;

}

/*上层装饰层 */
.mes::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;

  width: 100% !important ;

  height: 400px;
  background: url('https://iili.io/Bu2lBgR.png') no-repeat;
  background-size:contain;
  z-index: -1 !important;

  top: -102px !important; /*💽上下*/
}

/*下层装饰层*/
.mes::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;

  width: 100% !important; 

  height: 200px;
  background: url('https://iili.io/BXVDkUG.png') no-repeat;
  background-size: contain; 

  z-index: -3;
  bottom: -200px !important;  /*💽上下*/
}


/* ========头像与头像框========= */
/* 头像容器位置 */
.mesAvatarWrapper {
    position: absolute !important;
    top: -88px !important;    /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: 85% !important;   /* 💽左右微调 */
    transform: translateX(-50%) rotate(0deg) !important;
    width: auto !important;
    height: auto !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    z-index: 3 !important;
    overflow: visible !important;
    filter: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
}

/* 头像本体 */
.mesAvatarWrapper .avatar {
    width: 100px;  
    height: 100px;
    transform: scale(1) rotate(0deg) !important; /* 💽缩放与旋转 */
    transform-origin: center center !important;
    max-width: unset !important;
    max-height: unset !important;
    clip-path: polygon(0 0%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%, 0 100%);
    opacity: 1 !important;
}

.mesAvatarWrapper .avatar img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: none !important;
}

/* 头像框 */
.mesAvatarWrapper::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top:60% !important;   /* 💽上下 */
    left: 53% !important;  /* 💽左右 */
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 100% !important;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.5) rotate(0deg) !important; /* 💽改scale缩小放大 */
    background-image: url('');
    background-size: contain !important;
    background-position: center center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 3;
}

/* .2.名字与时间戳 */
/*必要的前置*/
.mes_block {
    position: relative !important;
    overflow: visible !important; 
    margin-top: 0px; 
    z-index: 10 !important;
}

/* 💽名字 */
.name_text {
    right: 15px !important; 
    left: auto !important;
    text-align: right !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    color: #7F7F7F !important;
    font-size: 14px !important;
    transform: rotate(0deg) !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 10;
    top: 10px !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
}


.name_text::before {
    content: '//'; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left:-2px;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.name_text::after {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0px;
    pointer-events: none;
}


/* 时间戳-大几率没做 */
.timestamp {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 10;
    top: -8px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: 10px !important;       
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 10px !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #7F7F7F !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.timestamp::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.timestamp::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0px;
}

/* 3. 三元素信息 (楼层、计时、词符) */
/* 楼层数 */
.mesIDDisplay {
    position: absolute !important;
    display: flex !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    top: 90px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: -15vw !important;        /* 💽左右微调*/
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 10px !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #7F7F7F !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}



.mesIDDisplay::before {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.mesIDDisplay::after {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 1px;
}

/* 回复计时 */
.mes_timer {
    position: absolute !important;
    display: flex !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    top: 90px !important;      /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: -24vw !important;       
    width: auto !important;
    text-align: center !important; 
    font-size: 10px !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    color: #7F7F7F !important; /* 颜色 */
    opacity: 1 !important;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    pointer-events: none;
}

.mes_timer::before {
    content: ''; 
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.mes_timer::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 1px;
}

/* 词符数 */
.tokenCounterDisplay {
    position: absolute !important;
    display: flex !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    top: 90px !important;     /* 💽上下微调 */
    left: -33vw !important;    /* 💽左右微调 */
    transform: rotate(0deg);
    font-size: 10px !important;
    font-weight: 500 !important;
    color: #7F7F7F !important; 
    -webkit-text-stroke: 0px #ffffff !important;
    paint-order: stroke fill !important;
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: 1 !important;
}

.tokenCounterDisplay::before {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 2px;
}

.tokenCounterDisplay::after {
    content: '';
    display: inline-block;
    margin-left: 0px;
}

/* 4. 操作按钮 (小铅笔、复制等 - 平时状态) */
.mes_buttons {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 9;
    top: -80px !important;      /* 💽上下位置 */
    right: 135px !important;    /* 💽左右位置 */
    transform:rotate(0deg) !important; 
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    margin: 0 !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;         
}

.mes_buttons > * {
    margin-left: 0px !important;
}

.mes[typing="true"] .mes_buttons {
    display: none !important;
    opacity: 0 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
}

.mes_buttons > div,
.mes_buttons button {
    opacity: 1 !important;
    visibility: visible !important;
}

.mes_buttons[style*="display: none"],
.mes_buttons[style*="display:none"] {
    display: none !important;
    opacity: 1 !important;
}


/* 编辑状态菜单 */
.mes_edit_buttons {
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: 15;
    top: 10px !important;      
    right: 165px !important;
    flex-direction: row;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0px;        
    opacity: 1 !important; 
    display: none; 
}

.mes_button, .extraMesButtons>div {
cursor: pointer;
    opacity:0.1 ;
    color: #fff !important;
opacity: 0.7 !important; 
}

/* 去除编辑、删除、重生成等按钮的阴影和发光 */
.mes_buttons div, 
.mes_edit,
.mes_text_paste {
    text-shadow: none !important;  
    box-shadow: none !important;   
    filter: none !important;       
}

.mes_buttons div:hover,
.mes_edit:hover {
    text-shadow: none !important;
}


.mes_buttons,
.mes .mes_buttons,
.mes:hover .mes_buttons {
    opacity: 1 !important;
}


/* -5. 文本框主体 - */
.mes_text {
    position: relative !important;
    padding-top: 30px !important;    /* 💽加大数值=文字下移，减小=文字上移 */
    margin-top: 0px !important;/*💿解除下移限制*/
    padding-bottom: 0px !important; /* 💽底部留白 */
    padding-left: 20px !important;   /* 💽左侧留白 */
    padding-right: 25px !important; /* 💽右侧留白 */
    min-height: 0px !important;  
    text-align: justify; 
    z-index: 2 !important; 
    text-justify: inter-word;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    word-break: break-word;
    line-height: 1.8;
}



/* 自定义图标 - 编辑按钮 (小铅笔) */
.fa-pencil::before,
.fa-pencil-alt::before {
  display: inline-block !important;
  width: 24px !important;
  height: 24px !important;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXWcAkF.png') !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-position: center center !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  vertical-align: middle !important;
  opacity: 0.3 !important;
  content: '' !important;

}

/* 自定义图标 - 菜单按钮 (省略号) */
.fa-ellipsis::before,
.fa-ellipsis-h::before {
  display: inline-block !important;
  width: 24px !important;
  height: 24px !important;
  background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXWYetf.png') !important;
  background-size: contain !important;
  background-position: center center !important;
  background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
  vertical-align: middle !important;
  opacity: 0.3 !important;
  content: '' !important;

}


/* 修复小铅笔/省略号*/
.mes_buttons, 
.mes_edit_buttons,
.mes_buttons *, 
.mes_edit_buttons *,
.mes_buttons div, 
.mes_edit_buttons button {
    text-shadow: none !important;
    box-shadow: none !important;
    backdrop-filter: none !important;
}

/* 底栏容器 */
#send_form {
    display: block !important; 
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: 100% !important;
    margin: 0 !important;
    position: relative !important;
    z-index: 10 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    border: none !important;
    padding: 8px 8px 8px 8px !important; 
    overflow: visible !important;
    height: auto !important; 
}


/* 背景层 */
#send_form::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute !important;
    top: -8px !important; 
    left: 0 !important; 
    right: 0 !important; 
    bottom: 0px !important;
    background-image: url('https://iili.io/BXW8Wyg.png') !important;
    background-size: 100% 100% !important;
    background-position: bottom center !important;
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    backdrop-filter: blur(0px) !important;
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(0px) !important;
    z-index: -2 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
}

/* 底栏装饰层 */
#send_form::after {
    content: "" !important;
    position: absolute !important;
    z-index: -1 !important;
    pointer-events: none !important;
    left: 120px !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 60px !important;
    top: -35px !important;
    background-image: url('') !important;
    background-size: contain !important;
    transform: scale(1.5) !important; 
    background-repeat: no-repeat !important;
    background-position: center bottom !important;
}


/* 输入框本体 */
#send_textarea {
    clip-path: none !important; 
    box-sizing: border-box !important;
    line-height: 18px !important;
    resize: none !important;      
    background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) !important; 
    color: #999999 !important; 
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease !important;
    border: 0px solid #000 !important; 
    box-shadow: inset 0px 0px 1px 1px  rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) !important; 
    border-radius: 1px !important; 
    padding: 5px 8px !important; 
    margin: 0 !important;
    width: 100% !important;
    height: 30px !important; 
    min-height: 30px !important;
    max-height: 30px !important; 
    overflow-y: auto !important;
    margin-bottom: 0px !important;
}


/* 交互状态：聚焦时*/
#send_textarea:focus {
    background-color: transparent !important; 
    border-color: #000 !important;
    box-shadow: inset 0px 0px 1px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0), 0 0 5px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) !important; 
    outline: none !important;
}

/* 移除底栏所有焦点外框 */
#send_form,
#send_form:focus,
#send_form:focus-within,
#send_form *:focus {
    outline: none !important;
    border: none !important;
}

/* 安卓点击高亮 */
textarea,
form {
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent !important;
}


/* 输入框提示词样式-别动 */
#send_textarea::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) !important;
}


/*底栏图标*/
#send_form [class*="fa-"]::before {
  content: '' !important;
  display: inline-block;
  width: 28px; /* 图片宽度 */
  height: 28px; /* 图片高度 */
